  scriptedFlavorTexts:
  - Jyrik swings his axe at Yuri.
  - Jyrik attempts to grab Yuri and unleashes frost at her.
  - Jyrik managed to grab Yuri, and now tries to blasts beams of frost at her face.
  - Despite breaking lose from his clutches, Jyrik fires more beams of frost at Yuri.
  - Jyrik unleashes a cloud above Yuri, which rains down frost.
  - Jyrik flings out many smaller frostbolts.
  - Jyrik unleashes many different sizes of snowball.
