  randomFlavorTexts:
  - Jyrik unleashes a small blizzard.
  - Jyrik unleashes the powers of lightning and fire.
  - Jyrik unleashes vast quantities of large fireballs.
  - Jyrik attempts to sandwich Yuri between frostbolts.
  - Jyrik unleashes bolts of lightning.
  - Jyrik stomps his foot down onto Yuri's, attempting to blast her with streams
    of fire.
  - Jyrik unleashes the power of frost and flame.
  maxHealth: 150
